  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "The most common side effects of (empagliflozin) are urinary tract infections (UTIs), genital yeast infections, and increased urination.",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "link": "https://www.boehringer-ingelheim.com/us/direct/medicines/jardiance"
          }
        ],
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "urinary tract infections (UTIs), genital yeast infections, and increased urination"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Side Effects"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Frequent urination and thirst: Your body removes extra sugar through urine, which pulls more water with it.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Genital yeast infections: Higher sugar levels in the urine encourage yeast growth. Symptoms include vaginal itching, discharge, or redness and itching around the penis.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              2,
              3,
              4
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Urinary tract infections (UTIs): Bacteria can multiply more easily due to sugar in the urinary tract. Signs include a burning feeling when you pee or cloudy urine."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Serious Risks"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dehydration and low blood pressure: Fluid loss can cause dizziness, fainting, or lightheadedness when you stand up.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              6,
              7
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA): A dangerous buildup of acid in the blood, which can happen even if your blood sugar is not very high. Symptoms include nausea, vomiting, stomach pain, tiredness, and trouble breathing.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              8
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Low blood sugar (hypoglycemia): Risk increases if you take Jardiance with insulin or other diabetes medications like sulfonylureas.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              9
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Severe genital infections (Fournier's gangrene): A rare but very serious bacterial infection of the tissue under the skin in the genital/perineal area.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Lower limb amputations: Increased risk of foot or leg amputations, especially if you have circulation issues or foot ulcers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you are taking Jardiance, would you like to know more about signs that require emergency medical care or tips to prevent yeast infections and dehydration?"
      }
    ],
